WEBVTT

39:50.417 --> 39:51.334
No, you idiot.

39:51.875 --> 39:53.417
Why would he be furious at you?

39:53.792 --> 39:55.250
He's furious at your younger son.

39:55.667 --> 39:58.792
If all this anger builds up…
And say, you die tomorrow,

39:59.084 --> 40:01.917
what if the elder one betrays his younger
brother while splitting the assets?
